## Summary
Indian National Security Adviser Ajit Doval visited China for border talks with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi. During the visit, Doval also discussed broader bilateral relations between the two countries with Chinese Vice President Han Zheng.

## Key Points
- Indian NSA Ajit Doval traveled to China for high-level border talks
- Doval held discussions with Chinese Foreign Minister Wang Yi focused on border issues
- Doval also met with Vice President Han Zheng to discuss overall India-China bilateral relations
- The meetings reflect continued diplomatic engagement between India and China despite ongoing border tensions


